#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_INFRASTRUCTURE_ZONE_FEEDING05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Feeding habitat enhancement device
#. 05 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt "ST_Infrastructure,KEY_GEAR_INFRASTRUCTURE_ZONE_FEEDING05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Place this block where animals eat to improve their diet with extra protein."
msgstr ""
"Umístěte proteinový blok na místo, kde se zvěř krmí, a obohaťte tak její "
"potravu o bílkoviny."

