#. Key:
#. KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_MAP01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 01 map01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_MAP01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Wildlife is feeding on invasive tansies, spurges and thistles that grow "
"here, damaging the ecosystem. Find and remove the invasive plants to improve"
" the quality of animal populations in the land."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř se tu živí invazními vratiči, pryšci a bodláky, což poškozuje místní "
"ekosystém. Najděte a odstraňte tyto rostliny, aby se zdejším populacím zvěře"
" lépe dařilo."

#. Key:
#. KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_MAP02_DESCRIPTION
