#. pollution 01 map02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_MAP02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Wildlife is feeding on jacks-in-the-bush and feverfews that grow here, "
"damaging the ecosystem. Find and remove the invasive plants to improve the "
"quality of animal populations in the land."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř se zde živí invazními sadci vonnými a řimbabami, což poškozuje místní "
"ekosystém. Najděte a odstraňte tyto rostliny, aby se zdejším populacím zvěře"
" lépe dařilo."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION01_NAME"
msgid "Invasive plant species"
msgstr "Invazní druhy rostlin"

#. Key:
#. KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 02 map01 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The lake polluted by tourists before Hearth & Hunt took charge is actively "
"damaging the local wildlife. Reduce the waste and purify the water to "
"improve the quality of animal populations in the land."
msgstr ""
"Jezero, které turisté znečistili ještě před převzetím rezervace společností "
"Hearth & Hunt, poškozuje místní zvěř. Odstraňte odpad a vyčistěte vodu, aby "
"se zdejším populacím lépe dařilo."

#. Key:
#. KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 02 map02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Severe droughts and excessive water extraction result in overly dry pans "
"such as this. Treat the water body, its soil and the surrounding area to "
"improve the quality of animal populations in the land."
msgstr ""
"Dlouhá sucha a nadměrné čerpání vody vysušují jezerní pánve, jako je tato. "
"Obnovte vodní plochu, půdu i okolní území, aby se zdejším populacím zvěře "
"lépe dařilo."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 02 map02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_MAP02_NAME"
msgid "Dry lake"
msgstr "Vyschlé jezero"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 02 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION02_NAME"
msgid "Polluted lake"
msgstr "Znečištěné jezero"

#. Key:
#. KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION03_MAP02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "infrastructure opportunity
#. pollution 03 map02 description"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/_Shared/ST_Infrastructure.ST_Infrastructure
msgctxt ""
"ST_Infrastructure,KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION03_MAP02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Not all locals and visitors dispose of garbage properly. Find and get rid of"
" these gradually formed litter hotspots to improve the quality of animal "
"populations in the land."
msgstr ""
"Ne všichni místní a návštěvníci odkládají odpad tam, kam patří. Najděte "
"místa, kde se postupně nahromadil, a odpad odstraňte. Pomůžete tak zdejším "
"populacím zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_INFRASTRUCTURE_OPPORTUNITIES_POLLUTION03_NAME
