#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INFBLV01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "description of how bolt18infblv01
#. is used"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
msgctxt ""
"ST_Ammunition,KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INFBLV01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Intended for hunting big game, these bolts enable better accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Tyto šípy do kuše jsou určeny k lovu velké zvěře a umožňují přesnější "
"střelbu."

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INFBSV01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "description of how bolt18infbls01
#. is used"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
msgctxt ""
"ST_Ammunition,KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INFBSV01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Intended for hunting big game, these bolts fly at a higher speed."
msgstr ""
"Tyto šípy do kuše jsou určeny k lovu velké zvěře a letí vyšší rychlostí."

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INJULV01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "description by which bolt18injulv01
#. is referred to"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Ammunition/_Shared/ST_Ammunition.ST_Ammunition
msgctxt ""
"ST_Ammunition,KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INJULV01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Intended for hunting small game, these bolts enable better accuracy but "
"don't penetrate the target."
msgstr ""
"Tyto šípy do kuše jsou určeny k lovu drobné zvěře a umožňují přesnější "
"střelbu, ale nepronikají do cíle."

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_AMMUNITION_CROSSBOWS_BOLT1822INJUSV01_DESCRIPTION
