msgstr "Primacy Vision Pillar 4-16x50"

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SCOPE16_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/Gear/Attachments/_Shared/ST_Attachments.ST_Attachments
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "scope16 custom01
#. description\nchanged during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Attachments/_Shared/ST_Attachments.ST_Attachments
msgctxt "ST_Attachments,KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SCOPE16_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Scope intended for both fast target acquisition at short ranges and high "
"precision at longer ranges."
msgstr ""
"Puškohled určený jak pro rychlé zaměřování na krátké vzdálenosti, tak pro "
"vysokou přesnost na delší vzdálenosti."

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SCOPE16_NAME
