#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SUPPRESSOR01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/Gear/Attachments/_Shared/ST_Attachments.ST_Attachments
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "suppressor01 description\nchanged
#. during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Attachments/_Shared/ST_Attachments.ST_Attachments
msgctxt "ST_Attachments,KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SUPPRESSOR01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Basic suppressor for up to 7.62mm-diameter calibers. Though smaller in size,"
" its reduction capabilities are still decent."
msgstr ""
"Základní tlumič pro střely o průměru do 7,62 mm. I přes menší rozměry účinně"
" tlumí hluk výstřelu."

