#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Attachments/_Shared/ST_Attachments.ST_Attachments
msgctxt "ST_Attachments,KEY_GEAR_ATTACHMENTS_SUPPRESSOR02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Suppressor with robust reduction capabilities for up to magnum 7.62mm-"
"diameter calibers."
msgstr ""
"Účinný tlumič pro náboje kategorie magnum se střelou o průměru do 7,62 mm."

