msgctxt "ST_Optics,KEY_GEAR_OPTICS_BINOCULARNVT01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Premium multispectral binoculars with thermal imaging. With its wide field "
"of view, it’s built for scanning forests and mixed terrain, delivering "
"maximum image detail and quick detection in daylight, darkness, or twilight."
msgstr ""
