msgctxt "ST_Weapons,KEY_GEAR_WEAPONS_RIFLEBOLT07_SX01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Classic bolt-action rifle suitable for smaller and medium-sized big game. "
"The aluminium-bedded system and the latest synthetics result in a rifle with"
" maximum stability."
msgstr ""
"Klasická opakovací kulovnice s odsuvným závěrem pro lov menších a středně "
