msgstr "Strasser RS14 WotH Edition"

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_WEAPONS_RIFLEBOLT27_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/Weapons/_Shared/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
