msgid "Bergara Limited Edition Reserva"
msgstr "Bergara Limited Edition Reserva"

#. Key:	KEY_GEAR_WEAPONS_RIFLEBOLT28_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Gear/Weapons/_Shared/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "riflebolt28 description\nchanged
#. during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Gear/Weapons/_Shared/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,KEY_GEAR_WEAPONS_RIFLEBOLT28_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This new version of the classic 700 design is a straight-pull repeater "
"suitable for small game. The receiver and Picatinny rails are made of "
"aluminium."
msgstr ""
"Tato nová verze klasické konstrukce 700 je kulovnice s přímotažným závěrem "
"vhodná pro lov drobné zvěře. Pouzdro závěru a lišty Picatinny jsou z "
"hliníku."

