msgctxt "ST_Weapons,KEY_GEAR_WEAPONS_RIFLEBOLT33_NXTCOMPOSITE01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Bolt-action rifle for stalking and stand hunting, particularly suitable for "
"driven hunts."
msgstr ""
"Opakovací kulovnice pro šoulačku a čekanou na posedu. Zvlášť se hodí na "
"naháňky."

